{
  "id": "workday",
  "name": "Workday",
  "match": [
    "myworkdayjobs.com",
    "myworkdaysite.com"
  ],
  "verifiedAgainstLiveForm": null,
  "notes": [
    "PARTIALLY VERIFIED. On 18 Sep 2026 the public part of the flow was checked",
    "against a live Workday tenant: the job posting page, the apply chooser",
    "(adventureButton -> autofillWithResume / applyManually / useMyLastApplication)",
    "and the apply-flow shell (applyFlowPage, progressBar, progressBarActiveStep,",
    "backToJobPosting, jobTitleHeading, signInContent, SignInWithEmailButton) all",
    "resolved exactly as written here.",
    "",
    "The form steps themselves could NOT be verified: Workday puts step 1 of 6",
    "behind mandatory account creation, so My Information, My Experience,",
    "Application Questions, Voluntary Disclosures and Self Identify are only",
    "reachable with credentials. Those selectors follow Workday's documented",
    "data-automation-id conventions and are exercised against fixtures/workday-like.html,",
    "but they have not been seen on a real form. Treat the first live run as the",
    "verification step and expect to correct some of them.",
    "",
    "Workday tenants also drift: the same data-automation-id can differ between",
    "tenant versions, which is why generic mode matters more here than elsewhere.",
    "",
    "submit is empty on purpose. Workday never has a single submit control - each",
    "step ends with bottom-navigation-next-button and only the final Review step",
    "submits, so matching a Next button would log an application that has not been",
    "sent. Detection falls back to the confirmation heuristic."
  ],
  "detect": {
    "any": [
      "[data-automation-id='applyFlowPage']",
      "[data-automation-id='legalNameSection_firstName']",
      "[data-automation-id='myInformationPage']",
      "[data-automation-id='progressBar']"
    ]
  },
  "meta": {
    "company": [
      "[data-automation-id='headerTitle']",
      "[data-automation-id='logo'] img[alt]",
      "meta[property='og:site_name']"
    ],
    "role": [
      "[data-automation-id='jobTitleHeading']",
      "[data-automation-id='jobPostingHeader']",
      "h1"
    ]
  },
  "submit": [],
  "confirm": [
    "[data-automation-id='applicationSubmitted']",
    "[data-automation-id='confirmationPage']"
  ],
  "widgets": {
    "combobox": {
      "trigger": "[aria-haspopup='listbox'], [data-automation-id$='Dropdown'], [data-automation-id='multiselectInputContainer']",
      "option": "[role='option'], [data-automation-id='promptOption']",
      "input": "input[role='combobox'], [data-automation-id='searchBox'] input"
    }
  },
  "fields": [
    {
      "id": "first_name",
      "selector": ["[data-automation-id='legalNameSection_firstName']"]
    },
    {
      "id": "last_name",
      "selector": ["[data-automation-id='legalNameSection_lastName']"]
    },
    {
      "id": "preferred_name",
      "selector": ["[data-automation-id='preferredNameSection_firstName']"]
    },
    {
      "id": "email",
      "selector": ["[data-automation-id='myInformationPage'] [data-automation-id='email']", "[data-automation-id='addressSection_email']"]
    },
    {
      "id": "phone",
      "selector": ["[data-automation-id='phone-number']", "[data-automation-id='phoneNumber']"]
    },
    {
      "id": "address_line1",
      "selector": ["[data-automation-id='addressSection_addressLine1']"]
    },
    {
      "id": "address_line2",
      "selector": ["[data-automation-id='addressSection_addressLine2']"]
    },
    {
      "id": "city",
      "selector": ["[data-automation-id='addressSection_city']"]
    },
    {
      "id": "state",
      "selector": ["[data-automation-id='addressSection_countryRegion']"]
    },
    {
      "id": "postal_code",
      "selector": ["[data-automation-id='addressSection_postalCode']"]
    },
    {
      "id": "country",
      "selector": ["[data-automation-id='countryDropdown']", "[data-automation-id='addressSection_country']"]
    },
    {
      "id": "how_did_you_hear",
      "selector": ["[data-automation-id='source']", "[data-automation-id='sourceSection']"]
    },
    {
      "id": "previously_employed",
      "selector": ["[data-automation-id='previousWorker']"]
    },
    {
      "id": "resume_file",
      "selector": [
        "[data-automation-id='resumeSection'] input[type='file']",
        "[data-automation-id='select-files']",
        "[data-automation-id='fileUploadInput']"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "current_company",
      "selector": ["[data-automation-id='company']"]
    },
    {
      "id": "current_title",
      "selector": ["[data-automation-id='jobTitle']"]
    },
    {
      "id": "school",
      "selector": ["[data-automation-id='school']"]
    },
    {
      "id": "degree",
      "selector": ["[data-automation-id='degree']"]
    },
    {
      "id": "field_of_study",
      "selector": ["[data-automation-id='formField-fieldOfStudy']"]
    },
    {
      "id": "linkedin_url",
      "selector": ["[data-automation-id='linkedinQuestion']"]
    },
    {
      "id": "earliest_start_date",
      "selector": ["[data-automation-id='dateInputWrapper']"]
    },
    {
      "id": "eeo_gender",
      "selector": ["[data-automation-id='gender']"]
    },
    {
      "id": "eeo_race",
      "selector": ["[data-automation-id='ethnicityDropdown']", "[data-automation-id='race']"]
    },
    {
      "id": "eeo_veteran",
      "selector": ["[data-automation-id='veteranStatus']"]
    },
    {
      "id": "eeo_disability",
      "selector": ["[data-automation-id='selfIdentifiedDisabilityData--disability']", "[data-automation-id='disability']"]
    }
  ]
}
